{"municipality_code":"11229","pref":"埼玉県","city":"和光市","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられる可能性があります。","display_comment_enriched":"和光市には、下新倉村、上新倉村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「午王山遺跡」、「四反歩遺跡」、「吹上貝塚」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、下新倉村や上新倉村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では大石真や清水かつらに注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":27,"rank":1064,"percentile":43.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":14,"rank":808,"percentile":56.5,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":29,"rank":885,"percentile":51.6,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":9,"rank":916,"percentile":46.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":4,"rank":1422,"percentile":22.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["大石真","清水かつら"],"tourism_landmarks":[],"food_culture":["埼玉のうどん（伝承地域: 県内全域）","呉